sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Cliente (navegador)
  participant G as API Gateway
  participant A as Auth Service
  participant O as orders
  participant I as inventory
  participant P as payments

  C->>G: POST /api/orders (Bearer, Idempotency-Key)
  G->>A: POST /internal/verify (X-Caller gateway)
  A-->>G: user_id, rol
  G->>O: POST / (X-Caller gateway, X-User-Id, X-User-Role)
  O->>I: POST /internal/reservations (X-Caller orders)
  alt hay stock
    I-->>O: 201 nombre y precio vigentes
    O->>O: calcula subtotal, descuento, envio y total
    O-->>G: 201 pedido PENDIENTE_PAGO
    G-->>C: 201
  else stock insuficiente
    I-->>O: 409 STOCK_INSUFICIENTE (sin descuento parcial)
    O-->>C: 409 via gateway
  end
  C->>G: POST /api/orders/{id}/pay (metodo, token)
  G->>O: POST /{id}/pay
  O->>P: POST /internal/charges (monto = total del servidor)
  alt aprobado
    P-->>O: APROBADO, ref, firma
    O->>O: PENDIENTE_PAGO a PAGADO
    O-->>C: 200 PAGADO
  else rechazado
    P-->>O: RECHAZADO
    O->>I: POST /internal/reservations/{id}/release
    O->>O: PENDIENTE_PAGO a CANCELADO
    O-->>C: 402
  else payments no responde
    P--xO: timeout o error
    O-->>C: 502/504, pedido sigue PENDIENTE_PAGO (reintento seguro)
  end
